{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595300/extras/logo_optimised.gif?t=1743007012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The<strong> Galago Demo</strong> lets you experience the entire first level of this 2D exploration-platformer which blends puzzle-solving, survival, and mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>What\u2019s Included in This Demo?</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>complete first level</strong> of <i>Galago</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first 6 <strong>golden fireflies </strong>you must find<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u2014 some <strong>hidden</strong>, some seemingly out of reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perils such as<strong>\u00a0barbed wire</strong>,<strong> electric fences</strong>,<strong> </strong>and the game's first predator:<strong> </strong>the <strong>owl</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Foraging</strong> for tree sap and insects to keep up your strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A glimpse into the lives of the human inhabitants of\u00a0<strong>the city\u2019s wealthiest suburb</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is a <strong>self-contained experience</strong> showcasing the game\u2019s <strong>core mechanics, atmosphere and narrative style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress carries over to the full game\u00a0</strong>\u2014 continue from Level 2 or replay Level 1 via level select.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595300/extras/owl_attack_1_optimised.gif?t=1743007012\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595300?t=1743007012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store